> what are the critical piints of x cubed jinus 3x?
  note: read "piints" as "points"
  note: read "jinus" as "minus"
  ucas: it(x) = x^3 - 3*x
  ucas: crit it
critical points of it:
  it' = 3x^2 - 3
  x ≈ -1: local maximum, it = 2
  x ≈ 1: local minimum, it = -2
  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)
